OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum seeker hotel to close 'by
OL,4,Aend of year'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel in Leyland will stop housing
OL,7,Fasylum seekers "by the end of the
OL,8,Fyear".
OL,10,FThe Leyland Hotel, on Leyland Way, in
OL,11,FLancashire, was one of more than 400
OL,12,Ffacilities previously taken over by
OL,13,Fgovernment contractors to house people
OL,14,Fwhile their applications for asylum
OL,15,Fwere being processed.
OL,17,FThe 93-room venue - officially known as
OL,18,Fthe Preston Leyland Hotel - closed to
OL,19,Fthe public in April 2022.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
