OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum seeker hotel to close 'by
OL,4,Aend of year'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,7,F(LDRS ) has seen government
OL,8,Fcorrespondence which says it will stop
OL,9,Fbeing used as an asylum facility
OL,10,F"before the end of the year".
